sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Worker
    actor Manager
    participant UI as QDTS Interface
    participant Defect as Defect Module
    participant CA as Corrective Action Module
    participant Loss as Loss Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Worker,DB: Defect Reporting

    Worker->>UI: Report defect (product, batch, stage, qty affected)
    UI->>Defect: Submit defect report
    activate Defect
    Defect->>DB: Create defect record (status = New)
    DB-->>Defect: Defect saved
    Note right of Defect: qty_affected ≤ batch quantity
    Defect-->>UI: Defect created
    deactivate Defect
    UI-->>Worker: Confirmation shown

    Note over Worker,DB: Manager Review and Assignment

    Manager->>UI: Open defect for review
    UI->>Defect: Start review
    activate Defect
    Defect->>DB: Update status = Under Review
    DB-->>Defect: Updated
    Defect-->>UI: Under Review
    deactivate Defect

    Manager->>UI: Assign corrective action
    UI->>CA: Assign action to worker
    activate CA
    CA->>DB: Create corrective action (status = Assigned)
    DB-->>CA: Action saved
    CA->>Defect: Sync defect status
    Defect->>DB: Update defect status
    CA-->>UI: Action assigned
    deactivate CA
    UI-->>Manager: Assignment confirmed

    Note over Worker,DB: Corrective Action Completion

    Worker->>UI: Complete assigned action (quantities, notes, evidence)
    UI->>CA: Submit completion
    activate CA
    CA->>Loss: Validate handled quantities
    Loss-->>CA: Valid
    CA->>Loss: Calculate loss from discarded units
    Loss-->>CA: calculated_loss
    CA->>DB: Update action and defect quantities
    DB-->>CA: Saved (Pending Review)
    CA-->>UI: Submitted for verification
    deactivate CA
    UI-->>Worker: Completion recorded

    Note over Worker,DB: Verification and Closure

    Manager->>UI: Verify corrective action
    UI->>CA: Verify action
    activate CA
    CA->>DB: Update action status = Verified
    DB-->>CA: Verified
    CA-->>UI: Verification complete
    deactivate CA

    Manager->>UI: Confirm root cause
    UI->>Defect: Confirm root cause
    activate Defect
    Defect->>DB: Update root cause investigation
    DB-->>Defect: Confirmed
    Defect-->>UI: Root cause confirmed
    deactivate Defect

    Manager->>UI: Close defect
    UI->>Defect: Close defect case
    activate Defect
    Defect->>Loss: Determine loss status
    Loss-->>Defect: loss_status
    Defect->>DB: Update status = Closed
    DB-->>Defect: Closed
    Defect->>DB: Record activity log entry
    Defect-->>UI: Case closed
    deactivate Defect
    UI-->>Manager: Closure confirmed

    Note over Worker,DB: Defect closes only after root cause confirmed and all non-cancelled corrective actions verified
